  baseline = RandomSampler without replacement ⇒ every image exactly once/epoch.
  weighting = with replacement ⇒ high-weight images repeat, low-weight images
  are missed. ⚠ OVER 100 EPOCHS coverage saturates (100x1600 draws >> 1600),
  which is why the per-epoch scale is the only informative one.

